# 默认：content 下所有文件都不处理文本和换行
** -text

# Life / Work / Inbox / Daily 下的 Markdown & Canvas 强制 LF
Life/**/*.md text eol=lf
Work/**/*.md text eol=lf
Inbox/**/*.md text eol=lf
Daily/**/*.md text eol=lf

Life/**/*.canvas text eol=lf
Work/**/*.canvas text eol=lf
Inbox/**/*.canvas text eol=lf
Daily/**/*.canvas text eol=lf